DOCUMENT();

loadMacros(
    "PGstandard.pl",    # Standard macros for PG language
    "PGML.pl",          # PGML markup and Math Objects
    "parserPopUp.pl",
    "PGcourse.pl",      # Customization file for the course
);

# Uncomment the following if you don't want to show which
# answers are correct and which are incorrect
#$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;

$rate = random(5.5,9.9,0.2);

@ans = ();

$ans[0] = sprintf("%0.0f",70/$rate);


BEGIN_PGML
After a signifcant political unrest, a country's currency has an approximate decay rate of about [$rate]% per month. If this is the case, then the half-life would be approximately [_]{$ans[0]} months (rounded to the nearest whole number).

END_PGML

ENDDOCUMENT();
